  <li><a href="sqlrclientprotoproxiedauth.html">Proxied Auth</a></li>
  <li><a href="sqlrclientprotokrb.html">Kerberos and Active Directory Encryption and Authentication</a></li>
  <li><a href="sqlrclientprototls.html">TLS/SSL Encryption and Authentication</a></li>
</ul>

